.\nTuổi: dùng \"be\", không dùng \"have\": \"I am ten years old\" hoặc ngắn gọn \"I am ten\". Không nói \"I have ten years\".\nSố: 20 = twenty, 28 = twenty-eight (có gạch nối), 100 = a hundred / one hundred.\n\"How many + danh từ số nhiều\": How many pens? How many cats?","lessonId":"u4n1l3","lessonVersion":"v2.u4n1l3","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u4n1","order":24,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u4n1l3","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"XKjg4E_3IRZBbDhKG6lGCapJQaH993bmikC95WEqFMaCevF33xNcgpeDJD6u5rFs3Ez-k8bdrhg7T3A8NcpDBA","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["listening","u4.grammar","u4.vocab"],"title":"Một, hai, ba · Bài 3","unitId":"u4"}